# Per-user overrides
settings.local.json

# Plans + audits — per-session narrative + per-user state.
# These directories carry rebuild / refactor / incident narrative
# AND runtime audit streams. They are kept locally as durable
# per-workspace state, but NEVER committed:
#   - Plans contain in-flight architectural decisions, per-author
#     drafts, and references to teammates / vendors / customers
#     that don't belong in shared history.
#   - Audits contain learning-event streams, Council-bypass logs,
#     and security audit reports — all of which can leak workspace
#     names, user identifiers, or sensitive scan output.
# Per global rule `~/.claude/rules/common/project-scoped-artifacts.md`
# (section "Gitignore + reference discipline"), no checked-in code
# file may REFERENCE `plans/` or `audits/` as a repo location —
# only as runtime paths (`<workspace>/.claude/plans/`).
plans/
audits/

# Project memory feedback files are committed; only local override
# files are ignored.
memory/.local/
